00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:47,560
They already had a bunch of other problems.

330
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,440
All right, so questions about this?

331
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:57,440
So in general, any time that you have a plan,

332
00:14:57,440 --> 00:15:00,240
so there's all these possible outcomes.

333
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:02,240
This is my best response in the first outcome.

334
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:03,600
This is my best response in the second outcome,

335
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,120
best response in the third outcome.

336
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,440
I worked this all out.

